{
  "name": "Day 12 — AI Content Repurposing Engine",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 12: AI Content Repurposing Engine\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: OpenAI API key\n- Connect: Google Sheets (Google OAuth)\n- RSS URL ko apne blog ke feed se badlo\n- \"Content Queue\" tab headers: title, link, linkedin, x_thread, instagram, newsletter, whatsapp, status\n\nCourse: Day 12 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ad5cf3c9-3301-4b06-a9c1-479552a2bdb9",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour"
            }
          ]
        },
        "feedUrl": "https://blog.n8n.io/rss/"
      },
      "id": "6fd10346-3da1-41b9-a1a3-8108d1443f5d",
      "name": "New Blog Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Tum ek senior social media writer ho. Neeche diye blog post ko 5 formats mein badlo. Tone: friendly, simple Hinglish, emojis kam.\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nSummary: {{ $json.contentSnippet }}\nLink: {{ $json.link }}\n\nRules:\n- linkedin: 120-180 words, hook line se shuru, 3 bullet takeaways, end mein sawaal\n- x_thread: 4 tweets ka array, har tweet 260 characters se kam\n- instagram: caption + 8 hashtags\n- newsletter: 80 words ka para + CTA\n- whatsapp: 2 line + link",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "412042e2-499e-4276-aa32-0aae9b4dd3cf",
      "name": "Repurpose with AI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "15e7fec6-15f0-42e8-a73e-5b65d9699b45",
      "name": "OpenAI Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"linkedin\": \"...\",\n  \"x_thread\": [\"tweet 1\", \"tweet 2\", \"tweet 3\", \"tweet 4\"],\n  \"instagram\": \"...\",\n  \"newsletter\": \"...\",\n  \"whatsapp\": \"...\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "633d90bf-87a1-4d55-af47-4eb420a3f775",
      "name": "JSON Format",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        310,
